\">Gefle</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:26.003%;left:78.712%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Brommapojkarna\"><img alt=\"Brommapojkarna\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna\">Brommapojkarna</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:25.994%;left:80.24%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"AIK\"><img alt=\"AIK\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;bottom:5px;left:-3em\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:-1px;right:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:26.296%;left:81.114%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Djurgården\"><img alt=\"Djurgården\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Fotboll\">Djurgården</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:27.153%;left:81.144%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Hammarby\"><img alt=\"Hammarby\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:8px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_Fotboll\" title=\"Hammarby Fotboll\">Hammarby</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:72.767%;left:62.964%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Kalmar FF\"><img alt=\"Kalmar FF\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Kalmar_FF\" title=\"Kalmar FF\">Kalmar FF</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:54.244%;left:26.78%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Elfsborg\"><img alt=\"Elfsborg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">Elfsborg</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:54.755%;left:16.695%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"GAIS IFK Göteborg Örgryte\"><img alt=\"GAIS IFK Göteborg Örgryte\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;top:5px;left:-3em\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/GAIS\" title=\"GAIS\">GAIS</a><br /><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_G%C3%B6teborg\" title=\"IFK Göteborg\">IFK Göteborg</a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:54.528%;left:16.167%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Häcken\"><img alt=\"Häcken\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><div style=\"position:relative;top:-8px;left:15px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken\" title=\"BK Häcken\">Häcken</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:83.517%;left:24.368%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"